spans.s:
tád,
 —1. as nom. acc. s. n. to ta, see ta; used
also in cpds and derivatives, see 497;
 —2.
as adv. there; yatra…tad, where…there,
103^18;
 —3. then, in that case, 27^17, 36^5;
ced…tad, if…then, 37^5; so yadi…tad,
37^12; tad…yad, then…when, 71^2; simply
continuative: tat ko vṛtras, who then
is V., 97^19; so 24^2;
 —4. in this way, i. e.
therefore, accordingly, 18^8, 1913, 22, 27^14,
etc.; yad…tad, since…therefore, 17^6;
so yatas…tad, 37^7. [cf. 495.]
